{"version":2,"exportedAt":1776908307358,"story":{"title":"Ollie's Outer Orbit Oops!","userPrompt":"An naughty octopus adventure in space","authorStyleId":"maurice-sendak","readingLevel":"fluent","illustrationStyleId":"storybook_classic","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Ollie the octopus was known for tricks. Not mean tricks, just… surprising ones. He lived deep in the blue, but dreamed of stars. He yearned to zoom past planets, a cosmic, inky blur. One day, a strange, shiny sphere drifted down. It hummed a happy tune, and Ollie's eight arms tingled with glee. He knew, just knew, this was his chance.","illustrationPrompt":"Whimsical children's book illustration. Ollie, a bright purple octopus with wide, curious eyes, gazes at a shimmering, golden sphere floating in the deep blue ocean. Other friendly sea creatures look on with wonder. The background includes colorful coral and playful fish. Colors: Bright, warm, playful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1776908204658,"durationMs":8727,"retries":0,"promptLength":818,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A medium Deep purple skin with subtle iridescent shimmer. Suckers are light pink. octopus, big-expressive Bright yellow eyes with yearning, hopeful, curious expression, wearing A small, brown leather pouch tied around one of his tentacles with a piece of seaweed., One slightly crooked tentacle, A small, star-shaped birthmark on his head, Large, expressive eyes, Always smiling, chubby build. Ollie, deep in the blue ocean, looks longingly up at a shiny sphere descending from space. He has a hopeful expression. The sphere hums. in Deep ocean floor, with sunlight filtering from above. Space visible far above the water.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"He hugged the sphere, all eight arms wrapped tight. It lifted him, slowly at first, then faster, faster! The ocean shrunk below. Ollie gasped! Stars! He was soaring, a purple speck against a black, velvet sky. Planets winked. Comets zoomed. Ollie giggled, a happy, bubbly sound that echoed in the empty space. But… he was all alone. He missed his friends.","illustrationPrompt":"Whimsical illustration. Ollie, looking excited and slightly nervous, floats in space, clinging to a golden sphere. Planets of various sizes and colors dot the background. Comets streak by. Ollie's expression should convey a mix of joy and slight loneliness. Colors: Deep blues, purples, and vibrant yellows.","imageMeta":{"provider":"none","generatedAt":1776908195936,"durationMs":4,"retries":0,"promptLength":803,"success":false,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A medium Deep purple skin with subtle iridescent shimmer. Suckers are light pink. octopus, big-expressive Bright yellow eyes with amazement, excitement, slight loneliness expression, wearing A small, brown leather pouch tied around one of his tentacles with a piece of seaweed., One slightly crooked tentacle, A small, star-shaped birthmark on his head, Large, expressive eyes, Always smiling, chubby build. Ollie is hugging the sphere with all eight arms as it lifts him into space. He's gasping in amazement. in Outer Space, with Earth (ocean shrinking) visible below. Stars and planets in the background.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":3,"text":"He spotted a small, green planet. On it lived the Zipples, fuzzy creatures with big ears. They zipped about, playing with space rocks. Ollie wanted to play too! He landed with a soft *thump*. The Zipples stared. Ollie smiled, a big, tentacled smile. He offered them a space rock he had found. But they just pointed and chattered.","illustrationPrompt":"Cute illustration. Ollie stands on a green, grassy planet, offering a space rock 